Springsteen: Deliver Me from Nowhere is a 2025 American biographical musical
drama film starring Jeremy Allen White as Bruce Springsteen.

11
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
Written and directed by Scott Cooper, and based on the 2023 book Deliver Me from Nowhere by Warren Zanes, as well as some elements from Springsteen's 2016
autobiography Born to Run,  it chronicles Springsteen's personal and professional struggles during the conception of his 1982 album Nebraska.

12
